{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Video Joiner &amp; Trimmer Pro 是一款影片合併與修剪工具，讓你一次整理多段影片，適合需要分享影片系列、整理拍攝素材或快速剪出精華片段的使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-233.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>合併修剪一次完成</h2>\n<p>Video Joiner &amp; Trimmer Pro 可把多段影片合併成單一檔案，適合整理片段或分享影片系列。你可從相簿加入影片或直接用相機拍攝，加入數量不限，合併結果可即時預覽；選定開始與結束時間即可修剪，並支援慢動作、快動作、適應模式與全模式，而且不加水印，所見即所得。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-235-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-236-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-237-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-238-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Video Joiner &amp; Trimmer Pro</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/video-joiner-trimmer-pro/id1076258090?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T04:29:42.518158+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":317,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T04:08:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T06:38:53.633136+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T04:23:18.632445+00:00","content_hash":"4b09e9ec6266b844ebe635e174a53d28dc32c64997cc3bbeec1c5111ef15dbe6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}